        {
            "heading": "Castle Fortifications",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "These buildings increase fort level, increasing the time it takes an attacking army to siege the holding and reducing the amount of free loot available to raiders."
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Rank 3 members of the Romuva Warrior Lodge can spend Renown to construct buildings in this series instantly and without the wealth cost."
