        {
            "heading": "Walls",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Walls increase levy size and fort level, raising the defensive capacity.  They also slightly increase yearly income from the holding."
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Rank 3 members of the Romuva Warrior Lodge can spend Renown to construct buildings in this series instantly and without the wealth cost."
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Theodosian Walls are the only unique building in the game, Constantinopole starts with them prebuilt in all start dates."
