                    "text": "Beyond contributing levy forces, many cultural buildings also give a bonus to the offence, defence, or morale levels of specific units. As these bonuses apply to the retinue of that character if these cultural buildings are built in the capital castle holding, placement of the capital can impact the quality of the army."
